{
  "order": 1,
  "title": "Age of Roots",
  "name": "The First Green",
  "color": "#7BD389",
  "icon": "minecraft:oak_sapling",
  "lore": [
    "The Heartstone remembers soil, then seeds, then the slow patience of trees. Roots push through the cracks of the Last Stone as if they had only been sleeping.",
    "Far above, at the very top of the stone, something stirs: the Weaver's Tree. A single heart-shaped bud.",
    "Out in the Void, the first root-bridge finds its way to Hearthmeadow, a scrap of the old meadows that clung to its own memory."
  ],
  "weaver": "Grow something together. Anything. That's how worlds begin.",
